<Product UniqueID="26199217" OrderID="0" ProdName="Kohler K-9000 P-Trap" IDTag="0" ProductDesc="Kohler K-9000 1-1/2 in adjustable P-trap, drawn as Kohler drew it (arm level). Origin = the arm centre line at the wall flange: set Elevation to the drain stub centre height. Inlet axis 1.500 in from the left end and 1.000 in from the front. The Kohler model puts the inlet 9-3/4 in from the flange face; the Kohler sheet prints 11-3/4 in. The arm is cut to length on site: place the trap by its inlet, under the drain." SourceLib="PM Fixtures and Appliances" NonGraphic="False" ImageFile="" SketchUpFile="Kohler K-9000 P-Trap.skp" UseSUModel="1" AutoFill="False" AutoDimension="True" Mirror="True" SUDirty="False" OrderDirty="False" Width="76.2" Height="170.61" Depth="273.05" WStretch="False" HStretch="False" DStretch="False" minW="0" minH="0" minD="0" MaxW="0" MaxH="0" MaxD="0" ModularWidths="False" ModularHeights="False" ModularDepths="False" ModularFFHeights="False" X="0" Elev="0" Rot="0" Outset="0" Wall="0" CabNo="0" Numbered="False" SnapTo="0" IsRectShape="True" DoorOR="" TopDrwOR="" MidDrwOR="" BotDrwOR="" DrwPullOR="" DoorPullOR="" HingeOR="" GuideOR="" GuideORSlowCloseOn="False" GuideORSpacerState="0" ShelfPinsOR="" DrawerFrontFastenerOR="" LockOR="" LegOR="" SpotLightOR="" LinearLightOR="" EndDoorOR="" BackDoorOR="" HardwareTextureORId="-1" LToeAdj="0" RToeAdj="0" TopDepthAdj="0" BottomDepthAdj="0" CurrentConst="1" ShowElevDepth="False" ExtEnds="0" Flags="1111111111111111" NoParts="False" DoorStyle="" FinInt="False" AutomateInterior="False" GrainMatched="0" ScribeRefWasExterior="True" PrevInteriorScribeStileWidths="" PrevInteriorScribeSideThicknesses="" Count="1" LockConst="False" EndsToFloor="0" CornerVoidAssigned="False" Notes="" Price="0" PricePerM="0" PricePerSqM="0" Upcharge="0" Weight="0" IncludeInCabCount="True" IncludeInLinearCalculations="True" IncludeInSqCalculations="True" PricingColumn="" NotchForLeftPanelEndFrontToe="True" NotchForLeftPanelEndBackToe="True"